      "name": "Spell Card \"Enemy Controller\"",
      "effect": "Pay 1000 LP, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; apply 1 of these effects.\n\u25cf Destroy it.\n\u25cf Immediately after this effect resolves, Tribute Summon 1 monster by Tributing monsters including the targeted opponent's monster, even though you do not control it.\nDuring your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY; add 1 \"Spell Card \"Enemy Controller\"\" from your Deck to your hand. You can only use 1 \"Spell Card \"Enemy Controller\"\" effect per turn, and only once that turn.",
      "official": false
